Physical Windows development-install checkpoint for exact HEAD `607a301b23c3543c47778038b605f6a5ce4d700b`.

Observed on target Windows:
- remote branch identity matched exact HEAD;
- previous installed update receipt was `90a8e16e6a1badecd3315968339ca691634b7ee4`;
- one old tray process was stopped before install;
- canonical `bootstrap-chat-platform.ps1 -LaunchTray` completed with `CHAT_PLATFORM_BOOTSTRAP=OK`;
- updater assets were installed and source/installed SHA256 matched for:
  - `chat-platform-tray.ps1`
  - `chat-platform-tray-update.ps1`
  - `chat-platform-update-core.ps1`
  - `chat-platform-update.ps1`
- installed tray registration check PASS;
- one new installed tray process was running;
- `PR150_DEVELOPMENT_INSTALL=PASS`.

`INSTALLED_VERSION_RECORDED=False` is expected for this development-install qualification because the bootstrap receipt is intentionally published only from a clean source whose HEAD exactly equals official `origin/main`; this exact PR head is not yet accepted main.

Next physical gate: visibly confirm the installed tray exposes exactly `Дополнительно -> Обновить`, then exercise the one-click Update action against current official main and verify fail-closed `target_missing_self_update_contract` without replacing the installed updater.

Physical Windows tray UX checkpoint for exact HEAD `607a301b23c3543c47778038b605f6a5ce4d700b`.

User-visible installed tray was observed after the exact development install:
- top-level platform status is visible;
- `Дополнительно` submenu is present;
- submenu contains exactly the intended one-click updater item `Обновить`;
- no separate `Проверить обновление` control is present;
- existing `Открыть журнал` entry remains present.

This satisfies the intended visible UX shape for the updater integration. Next physical action is a single click on `Дополнительно -> Обновить` against current official main, expecting fail-closed continuity protection because official main does not yet carry the #150 self-update contract.

Physical Windows continuity checkpoint for exact HEAD `607a301b23c3543c47778038b605f6a5ce4d700b`.

After the one-click updater correctly failed closed against current official `main`, the installed state was rechecked and the tray was restarted.

Observed:
- terminal updater result: `status=blocked`;
- `reason=target_missing_self_update_contract`;
- target main was `0223aa3f5e8a800c4e9eb61ec88e6703450fa9e0`;
- `restarted=False`;
- all four installed updater files remained byte-identical to the exact #150 development source after the blocked attempt;
- `UPDATER_BYTES_AFTER_BLOCK=PASS`;
- exactly one old tray process was replaced by exactly one new installed tray process;
- `PR150_TRAY_RESTART=PASS`;
- after restart, the visible tray still exposes `Дополнительно -> Обновить` and `Открыть журнал`.

This closes the updater continuity physical gate: a pre-#150 official main cannot erase the development-installed updater, and the updater survives a complete tray-process restart.
